      "role": "user",
      "content": "here's the text for 4.2: \"During peak demand months (June-August), the Supplier reserves the right to implement a price adjustment of up to 5% per gallon to account for market volatility. Such adjustments shall be applied automatically to the billing cycle following the adjustment date.\" \n\ndoes that give them the right to do it without us agreeing to it first? i need to know if it's safe to sign",
